<title>SINGAPORE: South Korea's KEPCO tenders to buy May LSWR.</title>
<headline>South Korea's KEPCO tenders to buy May LSWR.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korean Electric Power Corp (KEPCO) has issued a tender to buy 500,000 barrels of May low sulphur waxy residue (LSWR), a company official said on Friday.</p>
<p>The 500,000-barrel cargo is for delivery between May 11-15 to the ports of Ulsan and Pusan.</p>
<p>The tender closes March 19 and is valid for one day.</p>
<p>KEPCO last purchased 500,000 barrels of April 21-25 LSWR from South Korea's Yukong Ltd at $19.93 per barrel on a delivered and duty paid basis.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-870-3082)</p>
</text>
